{"Text":"    # MBTI Personality Profiles\n\n## ISTJ - The Inspector\nISTJs are responsible, practical, and detail-oriented. They value tradition, loyalty, and order. They approach tasks methodically and are reliable in fulfilling their commitments.\n\n## ISFJ - The Protector\nISFJs are caring, loyal, and traditional. They have a strong sense of responsibility and work diligently to meet others' needs. They value harmony and are attentive to practical details.\n\n## INFJ - The Counselor\nINFJs are insightful, principled, and compassionate. They seek meaning and connection in their relationships and work. They have a vision for a better future and work quietly to realize it.\n\n## INTJ - The Mastermind\nINTJs are strategic, independent, and analytical. They excel at developing systems and long-term plans. They value knowledge, competence, and logical solutions to complex problems.\n\n## ISTP - The Craftsman\nISTPs are practical, adaptable, and observant. They excel at understanding how things work and solving immediate problems. They value efficiency and tend to be independent.\n\n## ISFP - The Composer\nISFPs are gentle, sensitive, and artistic. They live in the present and enjoy creating beautiful or useful things. They value personal freedom and authentic expression.\n\n## INFP - The Healer\nINFPs are idealistic, empathetic, and authentic. They seek harmony between their inner values and outer actions. They care deeply about personal growth and helping others fulfill their potential.\n\n## INTP - The Architect\nINTPs are analytical, objective, and theoretical. They enjoy exploring complex ideas and finding logical solutions. They value knowledge, precision, and intellectual independence.\n\n## ESTP - The Dynamo\nESTPs are energetic, practical, and spontaneous. They excel at solving immediate problems and seizing opportunities. They value freedom, action, and tangible results.\n\n## ESFP - The Performer\nESFPs are enthusiastic, friendly, and spontaneous. They enjoy bringing people together and creating fun experiences. They value connection, enjoyment, and living in the moment.\n\n## ENFP - The Champion\nENFPs are enthusiastic, creative, and people-oriented. They see possibilities for people and are inspired to help others grow. They value authenticity, innovation, and meaningful connections.\n\n## ENTP - The Visionary\nENTPs are innovative, strategic, and adaptable. They enjoy theoretical discussions and solving complex problems. They value knowledge, competence, and intellectual stimulation.\n\n## ESTJ - The Supervisor\nESTJs are organized, practical, and decisive. They excel at implementing plans and maintaining order. They value tradition, structure, and clear expectations.\n\n## ESFJ - The Provider\nESFJs are warm, conscientious, and cooperative. They are attentive to others' needs and maintain social connections. They value harmony, belonging, and practical service.\n\n## ENFJ - The Teacher\nENFJs are charismatic, empathetic, and organized. They inspire others toward personal growth and collective goals. They value connection, harmony, and helping others develop.\n\n## ENTJ - The Commander\nENTJs are strategic, decisive, and assertive. They excel at organizing people and resources to achieve goals. They value competence, logical systems, and effective leadership.","Embedding":[-0.04874554,0.06434431,-0.14458477,0.0053100353,0.028459027,-0.009021767,0.047852524,-0.010356678,-0.011718757,0.019673439,-0.051787965,-0.0118937865,0.05520984,0.011995477,0.0009256198,-0.026367342,0.012425565,-0.05462311,0.012984219,0.010011605,-0.037096307,-0.029723981,-0.0144642,0.04221361,0.038162943,0.058272507,-0.0020695298,-0.026127016,-0.030943213,-0.0449028,0.052105647,-0.006605308,-0.026700059,-0.020764902,0.008358148,0.0146017745,0.105212264,0.07040335,0.046199817,-0.0044278037,0.03898258,-0.028884666,-0.029607175,-0.047114912,0.006992332,0.03937975,0.06334794,-0.018180862,0.05110712,-0.012482674,-0.0146219,-0.0053632692,0.080058195,0.0